// folds, two dented pillows), nightstand with a working lamp and an alarm clock that shows the game time, a six-drawer dresser
// (every drawer opens and has contents), a louvered two-door wardrobe with hanging shirts, a desk with the journal (save point),
// a ceiling fan on the wall switch, milk-crate shelves with a box fan, laundry, a guitar, a dive bag, posters and a corkboard.
// Interactions: bed (sleep), wardrobe, dresser_left / dresser_right, lamp_bedroom, switch_bedroom, save.
